# Shredder's Technique: "If an enchantment was destroyed this way, you lose 2 life." Bot2 saves its Springheart Nantuko,
# an enchantment creature, with a regeneration shield from Yavimaya Hollow (CR 701.19a): nothing was destroyed, so Bot1
# loses nothing. The scenario that lets the Nantuko die is the positive control, where an enchantment creature costs 2.

